// Source of truth: 工作区根目录《游园惊梦_完整剧情母剧本_V5.0.md》
// TASK-010: 第三章 3-1 ～ 3-4。四份认知的结构交互由 Runtime 承担，人物对白/心理保持 V5 原文。

=== room_opening ===
赵映按钱先生保存的旧房契丈量北侧外墙，又按室内房间深度粗略计算。 # speaker:narrator # kind:action # line:ch3.3-1.action.001
外面到这里还有三米多，里面却已经是墙。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-1.zhaoying.001
旧图上这一块没有登记房名。 # speaker:accountant # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-1.accountant.001
没有登记不代表没有。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-1.zhaoying.002
七年前的我，大概会跟你争这句话。 # speaker:accountant # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-1.accountant.002
现在不争？ # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-1.zhaoying.003
现在我只想知道，我到底从哪一天开始把“没写”当成“没有”。 # speaker:accountant # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-1.accountant.003
-> END

=== room_wife_memory ===
沈姨，你记得床放哪里，为什么不记得谁睡这里？ # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-2.zhaoying.001
我不是不记得。 # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-2.wife.001
那你说。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-2.zhaoying.002
……床靠东墙，早上太阳会先照到枕头。窗边有个矮书桌，桌腿坏过一次，老周垫了块木片。柜门上以前贴过一张剪坏的窗花，丑得很，我让人撕，你又给贴回去。 # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-2.wife.002
谁？ # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-2.zhaoying.003
别逼我现在说。 # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-2.wife.003
她连窗花丑不丑都记得，却不肯说房间属于谁。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:inner # line:ch3.3-2.inner.001
-> END

=== room_reconstructed ===
门后没有血迹、尸体或祭坛。只有一间普通得过分的旧房。床很窄，书桌矮，墙角还留着一块被家具压浅的印子。 # speaker:narrator # kind:narration # line:ch3.3-3.env
我以为门后至少会有什么能解释七年的东西。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:inner # line:ch3.3-3.inner.001
可这里像一个人只是出去吃了顿饭，然后再也没回来。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:inner # line:ch3.3-3.inner.002
赵映走到墙边。不同高度有几道铅笔刻线，旁边年份清楚，名字的位置却被反复磨过。 # speaker:narrator # kind:action # line:ch3.3-3.action.001
这些刻痕…… # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-3.zhaoying.001
别看了。 # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-3.wife.001
为什么？ # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-3.zhaoying.002
因为我当年磨的。 # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-3.wife.002
赵映回头。 # speaker:narrator # kind:action # line:ch3.3-3.action.002
名字是我磨掉的。刻痕没舍得。 # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-3.wife.003
-> END

=== room_identity ===
赵映用旧钥匙打开床板下一个生锈的小锁。盒子里不是案件证据，而是发夹、旧车票、学校徽章、一张写了一半的生日卡和一双小时候的布鞋。 # speaker:narrator # kind:action # line:ch3.3-4.action.001
这枚徽章我找了很多年。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:inner # line:ch3.3-4.inner.001
她拿起生日卡。开头写着——“阿映，十六岁以后……”后面没有写完。 # speaker:narrator # kind:action # line:ch3.3-4.action.002
这是我的字。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.zhaoying.001
嗯。 # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.wife.001
这间房是我的。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.zhaoying.002
没有任何人回答。 # speaker:narrator # kind:action # line:ch3.3-4.action.003
所以第六只杯子、侧路脚印、离家记录里被改掉的那个人…… # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.zhaoying.003
她慢慢把盒子盖上，又重新打开，像想确认里面的东西不会因为自己看第二次就变掉。 # speaker:narrator # kind:action # line:ch3.3-4.action.004
是我。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.zhaoying.004
赵映…… # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.wife.002
七年前我回来过。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.zhaoying.005
停顿很久。 # speaker:narrator # kind:action # line:ch3.3-4.action.005
是。 # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.wife.003
你们四个人知道。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.zhaoying.006
是。 # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.wife.004
然后你们把我从房间、照片、账本、路，能想到的地方全删了一遍。 # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.zhaoying.007
是。 # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.wife.005
为什么？ # speaker:zhaoying # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.zhaoying.008
沈夫人没有回答，只说了一句。 # speaker:narrator # kind:action # line:ch3.3-4.action.006
因为那是他摔下去以后，求我们的第一件事。 # speaker:wife # kind:spoken # line:ch3.3-4.wife.006
-> END
